{
  "desktop.attachWindow": {
    "notes": "会话命令。覆盖：title / className / processId / matchMode 三值 / timeoutMs 两值 / operationTimeoutMs。expect 的形状依据：outputs 四键与 resourceType='windowHandle' 来自 manifest 与实现；'找不到' 的 ELEMENT_NOT_FOUND + details.matchedCount=0 与 '无任何过滤 → INVALID_INPUT' 都是 tests/contract/test_desktop_contract.py 与 test_desktop_attach_window.py 在门禁里实测过的。contains/regex 两个变体会走 EnumWindows 全桌面枚举（不是 FindWindowW 快路径），真机耗时更长但不影响结论。",
    "variants": [
      {
        "name": "exact-title-binds-the-fixture-window",
        "notes": "显式给出 operationTimeoutMs 的一个取值：它是『单次操作』预算，与 timeoutMs（等窗口出现的总预算）是两个参数，覆盖校验要求它至少有合法值 + 另一个取值两侧。",
        "inputs": {
          "title": "{appTitle}",
          "matchMode": "exact",
          "timeoutMs": 5000,
          "operationTimeoutMs": 2000
        },
        "setup": {
          "session": "none"
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputs": {
            "resourceType": "windowHandle"
          },
          "outputKeys": [
            "sessionId",
            "resourceType",
            "processId",
            "workWindowId"
          ],
          "effect": "session"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "contains-mode-matches-a-title-substring",
        "inputs": {
          "title": "Desktop Demo",
          "matchMode": "contains",
          "timeoutMs": 5000
        },
        "setup": {
          "session": "none"
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputKeys": [
            "sessionId",
            "workWindowId"
          ],
          "effect": "session"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "regex-mode-matches-the-whole-title",
        "inputs": {
          "title": "^RPA Core .*Demo$",
          "matchMode": "regex",
          "timeoutMs": 5000
        },
        "setup": {
          "session": "none"
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputKeys": [
            "sessionId",
            "workWindowId"
          ],
          "effect": "session"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "class-name-is-compared-by-equality-and-can-miss",
        "notes": "className 恒为等值比较（matchMode 只管 title），所以给一个真实存在窗口配一个错的类名必然找不到；details.className 原样回带，是 test_desktop_attach_window.py 钉过的契约。",
        "inputs": {
          "title": "{appTitle}",
          "className": "Notepad",
          "timeoutMs": 200
        },
        "setup": {
          "session": "none"
        },
        "expect": {
          "errorCode": "ELEMENT_NOT_FOUND",
          "errorDetails": {
            "className": "Notepad"
          }
        },
        "negative": true
      },
      {
        "name": "no-filter-at-all-is-invalid-input",
        "inputs": {},
        "setup": {
          "session": "none"
        },
        "expect": {
          "errorCode": "INVALID_INPUT"
        },
        "negative": true
      },
      {
        "name": "process-id-narrows-to-the-fixture-process",
        "inputs": {
          "title": "{appTitle}",
          "processId": "{pid}",
          "timeoutMs": 5000
        },
        "setup": {
          "session": "none"
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputKeys": [
            "sessionId",
            "processId"
          ],
          "outputs": {
            "processId": "{pid}"
          },
          "effect": "session"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "unknown-process-id-is-not-found",
        "notes": "processId=999999 是按 min=1 取的第二侧取值：证明 processId 真的参与了筛选（不是被静默忽略）。",
        "inputs": {
          "title": "{appTitle}",
          "processId": 999999,
          "timeoutMs": 200
        },
        "setup": {
          "session": "none"
        },
        "expect": {
          "errorCode": "ELEMENT_NOT_FOUND"
        },
        "negative": true
      },
      {
        "name": "unknown-title-reports-zero-matches",
        "inputs": {
          "title": "no-such-window-rpa-core-probe",
          "timeoutMs": 200
        },
        "setup": {
          "session": "none"
        },
        "expect": {
          "errorCode": "ELEMENT_NOT_FOUND",
          "errorDetails": {
            "matchedCount": 0
          }
        },
        "negative": true
      },
      {
        "name": "operation-timeout-budget-is-consumed",
        "notes": "operationTimeoutMs 与 timeoutMs 是两个不同预算（前者是单次操作超时，后者是等窗口出现的总预算）。此变体只证明它被接受且不改变成功结论——真机上是哪一个先到期需要专门造慢窗口才能区分，不在本表的证据面内。",
        "inputs": {
          "title": "{appTitle}",
          "timeoutMs": 5000,
          "operationTimeoutMs": 4000
        },
        "setup": {
          "session": "none"
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputKeys": [
            "sessionId"
          ],
          "effect": "session"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "desktop.activateWindow": {
    "notes": "窗口级命令，只要会话。注意它会真的抢前台焦点——装配在每个变体开始前都会重新抢一次前台，顺序不敏感。",
    "variants": [
      {
        "name": "activates-the-session-window",
        "inputs": {
          "sessionId": "{session}"
        },
        "expect": {
          "effect": "unsafe-write"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "missing-session-is-explicit",
        "inputs": {
          "sessionId": "no-such-session"
        },
        "expect": {
          "errorCode": "SESSION_NOT_FOUND"
        },
        "negative": true
      },
      {
        "name": "empty-session-string-falls-back-to-the-default-session",
        "inputs": {
          "sessionId": ""
        },
        "expect": {
          "effect": "unsafe-write"
        },
        "notes": "空会话串的实测语义（2026-09-22 执行层首跑校正）：`resolve_session_id` 把空串当「未提供」（`str(requested or '').strip()` 为空即回退），于是命令落到**默认会话**上，并不存在「拿空串去匹配某个会话」这一步——这才是『空串不是通配符』的真实含义。 本命令只吃会话，所以回退之后就是一次正常执行；`missing-session-is-explicit` 那条才是真正的失败路径。"
      }
    ]
  },
  "desktop.click": {
    "notes": "有副作用的指针命令。本表测的是参数整形与结果契约；'点下去真的生效'在真机 E2E 里验（tests/e2e/test_desktop_pause_resume.py 用非幂等计数器钉住『只点了一次』）。靶子元素用 countButton（点它只让计数器加一，无其它副作用）。",
    "variants": [
      {
        "name": "default-click-on-the-count-button-succeeds",
        "notes": "把四个缺省值显式写出来：枚举覆盖要求每个取值至少出现一次，而 single / left / center / postDelayMs=0 恰好**全是缺省值**——不显式写出来就没有任何变体『出现』过它们，覆盖校验会红。",
        "inputs": {
          "sessionId": "{session}",
          "elementId": "{element:count}",
          "clickType": "single",
          "button": "left",
          "clickPosition": "center",
          "postDelayMs": 0
        },
        "setup": {
          "find": {
            "count": {
              "automationId": "countButton",
              "controlType": "Button"
            }
          }
        },
        "expect": {
          "effect": "unsafe-write"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "double-click-type-is-accepted",
        "inputs": {
          "sessionId": "{session}",
          "elementId": "{element:count}",
          "clickType": "double"
        },
        "setup": {
          "find": {
            "count": {
              "automationId": "countButton",
              "controlType": "Button"
            }
          }
        },
        "expect": {
          "effect": "unsafe-write"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "right-button-is-accepted",
        "inputs": {
          "sessionId": "{session}",
          "elementId": "{element:count}",
          "button": "right"
        },
        "setup": {
          "find": {
            "count": {
              "automationId": "countButton",
              "controlType": "Button"
            }
          }
        },
        "expect": {
          "effect": "unsafe-write"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "modifiers-are-accepted",
        "notes": "带辅助键会强制走真实鼠标路径（invoke() 表达不了组合键）——这条在 test_desktop_click_plan.py 里钉过。",
        "inputs": {
          "sessionId": "{session}",
          "elementId": "{element:count}",
          "modifiers": [
            "Ctrl"
          ]
        },
        "setup": {
          "find": {
            "count": {
              "automationId": "countButton",
              "controlType": "Button"
            }
          }
        },
        "expect": {
          "effect": "unsafe-write"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "simulate-human-false-takes-the-shortest-path",
        "inputs": {
          "sessionId": "{session}",
          "elementId": "{element:count}",
          "simulateHuman": false
        },
        "setup": {
          "find": {
            "count": {
              "automationId": "countButton",
              "controlType": "Button"
            }
          }
        },
        "expect": {
          "effect": "unsafe-write"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "random-position-lands-inside-the-element",
        "notes": "clickPosition=random 会走真实鼠标路径并在元素矩形内取点（带 0.15~0.85 内缩）。真机上只能断言『没报错』——落点具体坐标是内部的，不进 outputs。",
        "inputs": {
          "sessionId": "{session}",
          "elementId": "{element:count}",
          "clickPosition": "random"
        },
        "setup": {
          "find": {
            "count": {
              "automationId": "countButton",
              "controlType": "Button"
            }
          }
        },
        "expect": {
          "effect": "unsafe-write"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "post-delay-is-consumed",
        "notes": "postDelayMs 是『只改变时长、不进任何 args』的参数，唯一能证明它被消费的方式是墙钟下界（不消费的实现会立刻返回）。",
        "inputs": {
          "sessionId": "{session}",
          "elementId": "{element:count}",
          "postDelayMs": 200
        },
        "setup": {
          "find": {
            "count": {
              "automationId": "countButton",
              "controlType": "Button"
            }
          }
        },
        "expect": {
          "effect": "unsafe-write",
          "elapsedAtLeastMs": 200
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "timeout-budget-is-consumed-when-the-element-is-there",
        "inputs": {
          "sessionId": "{session}",
          "elementId": "{element:count}",
          "timeoutMs": 2000
        },
        "setup": {
          "find": {
            "count": {
              "automationId": "countButton",
              "controlType": "Button"
            }
          }
        },
        "expect": {
          "effect": "unsafe-write"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "unknown-element-id-is-element-not-found",
        "notes": "会话在、元素 id 不在 → ELEMENT_NOT_FOUND（desktop.py 的元素解析通用路径）。这是本表适用面最广的一条负路径：所有吃 elementId 的命令都是同一个码。",
        "inputs": {
          "sessionId": "{session}",
          "elementId": "no-such-element",
          "timeoutMs": 200
        },
        "expect": {
          "errorCode": "ELEMENT_NOT_FOUND"
        },
        "negative": true
      },
      {
        "name": "missing-session-is-explicit",
        "inputs": {
          "sessionId": "no-such-session",
          "elementId": "no-such-element"
        },
        "expect": {
          "errorCode": "SESSION_NOT_FOUND"
        },
        "negative": true
      }
    ]
  },
  "desktop.closeSession": {
    "notes": "本变体用的是自己那个会话（装配默认就给每个变体自建一个），所以关掉它不会影响别的变体——这正是『每变体自建会话』这个取舍换来的东西。forceKill 只覆盖默认的 false：true 会真的结束靶子进程，会把整个矩阵的靶子毁掉，需要单独一个靶子实例才能测（登记在任务单 §3）。",
    "variants": [
      {
        "name": "closes-a-session-it-owns",
        "inputs": {
          "sessionId": "{session}",
          "forceKill": false
        },
        "expect": {
          "effect": "session"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "missing-session-is-explicit",
        "inputs": {
          "sessionId": "no-such-session"
        },
        "expect": {
          "errorCode": "SESSION_NOT_FOUND"
        },
        "negative": true
      },
      {
        "name": "empty-session-string-falls-back-to-the-default-session",
        "inputs": {
          "sessionId": ""
        },
        "expect": {
          "effect": "session"
        },
        "notes": "空会话串的实测语义（2026-09-22 执行层首跑校正）：`resolve_session_id` 把空串当「未提供」（`str(requested or '').strip()` 为空即回退），于是命令落到**默认会话**上，并不存在「拿空串去匹配某个会话」这一步——这才是『空串不是通配符』的真实含义。 本命令只吃会话，所以回退之后就是一次正常执行；`missing-session-is-explicit` 那条才是真正的失败路径。"
      }
    ]
  },
  "desktop.drag": {
    "notes": "靶子已补可拖控件 dragHandle（Label，按下后自身跟着鼠标走，MouseUp 把最终位置写进 dragStatus）。正路径的终点用 {windowCenterX}/{windowCenterY} 占位符——drag 的 targetX/targetY 是绝对屏幕坐标，而窗口位置随会话漂移（本机实测 CenterScreen 把窗口放到了 y=-765），写死坐标要么落在窗口外、要么把真实鼠标甩到桌面上无关的位置。本表仍只断言『命令成功 + effect 提交』：拖拽是否真的作用到了元素上，由 tests/e2e/test_desktop_target_effects.py 读 dragStatus 钉住（命令返回 success 证明不了鼠标动过）。",
    "variants": [
      {
        "name": "drags-the-handle-into-the-window-center",
        "notes": "正路径：元素与终点都在窗口内，真实鼠标按下-移动-松开。副作用（dragStatus）不在本表断言，见 notes 与 e2e 用例。",
        "setup": {
          "find": {
            "handle": {
              "backend": "uia",
              "automationId": "dragHandle"
            }
          }
        },
        "inputs": {
          "sessionId": "{session}",
          "elementId": "{element:handle}",
          "targetX": "{windowCenterX}",
          "targetY": "{windowCenterY}"
        },
        "expect": {
          "effect": "unsafe-write"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "unknown-element-id-is-element-not-found",
        "inputs": {
          "sessionId": "{session}",
          "elementId": "no-such-element",
          "targetX": 100,
          "targetY": 100
        },
        "expect": {
          "errorCode": "ELEMENT_NOT_FOUND"
        },
        "negative": true
      },
      {
        "name": "target-far-outside-the-element-still-fails-on-the-element-first",
        "notes": "先解析元素再算坐标：元素不存在时不该因为坐标越界换一个错误码。",
        "inputs": {
          "sessionId": "{session}",
          "elementId": "no-such-element",
          "targetX": 99999,
          "targetY": 99999
        },
        "expect": {
          "errorCode": "ELEMENT_NOT_FOUND"
        },
        "negative": true
      },
      {
        "name": "missing-session-is-explicit",
        "inputs": {
          "sessionId": "no-such-session",
          "elementId": "no-such-element",
          "targetX": 0,
          "targetY": 0
        },
        "expect": {
          "errorCode": "SESSION_NOT_FOUND"
        },
        "negative": true
      }
    ]
  },
  "desktop.findElement": {
    "notes": "本表是『元素 id 的来源』。expect 里的 matchedCount=1 不是猜的：实现只在唯一匹配时成功（歧义另有 ELEMENT_AMBIGUOUS），这个字段目前是常量 1（desktop.py 的 findElement 成功分支）。locator 的内部字段（automationId / controlType / title / className / foundIndex / backend）不是 input_schema 的顶层属性，本表用几个不同形状的 locator 覆盖它，而不是逐个字段展开。",
    "variants": [
      {
        "name": "automation-id-and-control-type-resolve-the-input-box",
        "inputs": {
          "sessionId": "{session}",
          "locator": {
            "automationId": "queryInput",
            "controlType": "Edit"
          },
          "timeoutMs": 5000
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputs": {
            "matchedCount": 1
          },
          "outputKeys": [
            "elementId",
            "matchedCount"
          ],
          "effect": "read"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "locator-without-a-control-type-still-resolves",
        "inputs": {
          "sessionId": "{session}",
          "locator": {
            "automationId": "countLabel"
          },
          "timeoutMs": 5000
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputKeys": [
            "elementId",
            "matchedCount"
          ],
          "effect": "read"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "longer-wait-budget-is-accepted",
        "inputs": {
          "sessionId": "{session}",
          "locator": {
            "automationId": "submitButton",
            "controlType": "Button"
          },
          "timeoutMs": 2000
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputKeys": [
            "elementId"
          ],
          "effect": "read"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "unknown-automation-id-is-element-not-found",
        "inputs": {
          "sessionId": "{session}",
          "locator": {
            "automationId": "no-such-control-xyz"
          },
          "timeoutMs": 200
        },
        "expect": {
          "errorCode": "ELEMENT_NOT_FOUND"
        },
        "negative": true
      },
      {
        "name": "missing-session-is-explicit",
        "inputs": {
          "sessionId": "no-such-session",
          "locator": {
            "automationId": "queryInput"
          }
        },
        "expect": {
          "errorCode": "SESSION_NOT_FOUND"
        },
        "negative": true
      },
      {
        "name": "a-locator-matching-many-controls-is-ambiguous",
        "notes": "歧义面：靶子上有多个 Text 控件（各个 Label），唯一匹配才成功。不按值断言 matchedCount——它随靶子控件数变化（增删一个 Label 就该变），钉住『≥2 个匹配必须报 ELEMENT_AMBIGUOUS』这个判据本身才有意义。",
        "inputs": {
          "sessionId": "{session}",
          "locator": {
            "controlType": "Text"
          },
          "timeoutMs": 200
        },
        "expect": {
          "errorCode": "ELEMENT_AMBIGUOUS"
        },
        "negative": true
      }
    ]
  },
